index-*.css
index-*.js
index-*.html

# Live-proof runtime artifacts (Chromium profiles, tmp session state, per-run
# reports). Evidence stays on disk; final summaries and digests belong in
# docs/superpowers/audits/. Existing tracked evidence remains tracked.
build/browser-live-proof/
